<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29241" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσμή</span></b> , ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽδύὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσις</span>
			, <i>setting</i>, mostly in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀελίου δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1245
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				61e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δυσμῇσιν ἐών</span> at
			the point of <i>setting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.104
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ ἡλίου δυσμάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					1.39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥλιος ἦν ἤδη περὶ δυσμάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hell.Oxy.</u>
					15.5
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γῆρας δυσμαὶ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1457b25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				4.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.678
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				9.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.Oen.
				2
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the quarter of sunset, west</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ ἑσπέρης τε καὶ [ἡλίου] δυσμέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἡλίου δυσμέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.115
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς δυσμαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					232
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατολαί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1049.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυθμή</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Cer.</u>
				10
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				539
			</span></i> (sg.).</div>
